# Rendered or hand-filled env files hold secrets; only the examples are tracked.
*.env
.env
# commonly-bot accounts and runtime tokens, copied or written at runtime.
commonly-bot-state/
# Rendered from the Helm chart on each deploy (docs/deployment/single-vm.md).
litellm/config.yaml
# A render killed mid-write leaves its temp file here; it holds secrets too.
.render-*
